Looking at the project snapshot, I need to expose runtime metrics to the client in a protocol-first way. Currently, metrics exist server-side (`MetricsTracker`) but are never sent to clients.

## Root Cause
Runtime metrics are tracked internally but not exposed through the protocol. The `session.state` message doesn't include metrics, and the client has no way to receive them.

## Smallest Protocol-First Fix

### 1. Protocol Layer - Add metrics to session.state message

**File: `packages/protocol/src/messages.ts`**

